note bce fixture diag: one erasable get (K 10 < len 16, line 9 of the unit with its lead line) and one
note kept get (index add i 1, line 10). With om2 diag bce the unit's stderr has exactly one forbnd record,
note for line 9, and three omc-site records instead of four. Exit 10 passes of 2 + 2 = 40.
fn main to int
v = new ulong 16 2
s = ulong 0
for i ulong 10
s = add s get v i
s = add s get v add i 1
end
ret int s
end
